Z||000004||Monkeyman||02-07-2001||05:52 PM||||I'm a smoker (about 3 pks/day) but rarely use my ashtrays.  (That's what they make a window for.)  There's an awful lot of "stuff" under the ashtrays.  I'm not sure you could fit much under there without spoiling the lines of the dash and having something raised.  Might have enough room for a starter switch though.  Hmmm....||||reg||1
Z||000005||gixxer||02-07-2001||06:29 PM||||Got two "toggle microswitches" in there on my car using the ashtray insert. For switches, you have to use the inboard edge and mount them at an angle to avoid a plastic ledge (inboard) and a tube(outboard). The door closes over it all nicely. ||||reg||1
