Z||000009||MontanaFiero||02-08-2001||03:11 AM||||I put a cup holder on my console and it covered the passengers ashtray completely. I can still access the driver's side ash tray for parking change (since we don't have "toll roads" in Montana). I got my cup holder from Minnesota Fiero's Forever- <A HREF="http://www.fiero.mn.org" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.mn.org</A>  -they don't have a picture on their web site, but it looks good. email them and I bet they'd send you a picture. The most convenient addition I've made to my car. (considering I dumped a "Big Gulp" in the passenger seat without it).  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>If you need a lid/ tray and don't have one, e-mail me  <A HREF="mailto:blee291@home.com">blee291@home.com</A> ||||reg||1
