Z||000014||MontanaFiero||02-09-2001||02:45 AM||||Here's a great addition that we all need--<BR>a cup holder (OK so mine's a little dirty, I actually use it. As you can see, I still have access to my "ash hole".<P>I attached this with Velcro, so it can be removed to have access under the console.<P><B>For those of you in California/ Florida, that blue thing is a <I>SNOW BRUSH</I>, not the <I>CLUB</I></B> <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1518249&a=11475761&p=40471140">  <P><BR>------------------<BR>&gt;&gt; '87 Coupe 4 cyl, auto &lt;&lt;<BR>&gt;&gt; '86 SE V6, 4 speed- project &lt;&lt;<p>[This message has been edited by MontanaFiero (edited 02-09-2001).]||||reg||2
